    "text": "To determine how old Marianne will be when Bella turns 18, we need to follow these steps:\n\n1. Determine the age difference between Marianne and Bella.\n2. Calculate how many years it will take for Bella to turn 18.\n3. Add this number of years to Marianne's current age.\n\nFirst, we know that Marianne was 20 years old when Bella was 8 years old. The age difference between Marianne and Bella is:\n\\[ 20 - 8 = 12 \\text{ years} \\]\n\nNext, we need to find out how many years it will take for Bella to turn 18. Since Bella is currently 8 years old, the number of years until Bella is 18 is:\n\\[ 18 - 8 = 10 \\text{ years} \\]\n\nNow, we add these 10 years to Marianne's current age of 20 years to find out how old Marianne will be when Bella is 18:\n\\[ 20 + 10 = 30 \\]\n\nTherefore, Marianne will be \\(\\boxed{30}\\) years old when Bella turns 18.",
